WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.320
The year 2300.

2
00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.460
There is a place that isn't on any map.

3
00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.920
It all began with a silent sleep.

4
00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:13.390
It belongs to no universe.

5
00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:15.550
Its name is Elyra.

6
00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:17.170
A distant planet.

7
00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:18.550
Elyra.

8
00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:23.170
Floating islands, crystal forests, and a deep sleep.

9
00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.270
23 capsules were waiting.

10
00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:26.980
Warning!

11
00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:28.030
The capsule is collapsing!

12
00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:29.610
AyShe, you have to get out now!

13
00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:32.890
Wait! What's happening?

14
00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:37.900
In capsule 23, a heart began to beat again.

15
00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:41.670
Where am I? Who am I?

16
00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:44.870
But she didn't remember where she was.

17
00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:46.850
201 years?

18
00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:49.870
Good morning, AyShe.

19
00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:51.370
Or good night.

20
00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:53.610
Time gets a little confusing around here.

21
00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:55.030
I'm Pusula.

22
00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:57.320
Pusula was her only guide.

23
00:00:57.370 --> 00:01:00.070
I've been waiting for you for 201 years.

24
00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:03.070
Come on, get up. There's a world I need to show you.

25
00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:05.130
The door opened.

26
00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:09.890
AyShe stepped into a world no one had seen for centuries.

27
00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:12.470
This isn't Earth.

28
00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:15.690
Elyra stands in the void between universes.

29
00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:17.430
It's on no map.

30
00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:20.480
So why is everything so...

31
00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:21.530
Dead?

32
00:01:22.570 --> 00:01:24.170
Because it was waiting for you.

33
00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:27.210
Watch out! On your left!

34
00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:30.430
The Crystal Forest was alive.

35
00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:33.570
And with every step, eyes were watching her.

36
00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:37.690
23. This number is everywhere.

37
00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:40.130
And then Taran, the keeper, appeared.

38
00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:42.550
At last you've come, 23.

39
00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:44.130
Who are you?

40
00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:46.590
I am Taran, the keeper of Elyra.

41
00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:51.360
In 2099, as the Earth was dying, 23 people were put to sleep.

42
00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:54.710
The code of humanity was inside her.

43
00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:56.070
Why me?

44
00:01:56.830 --> 00:01:58.730
Your chromosomes remember.

45
00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:01.510
You are the one who will awaken this continent.

46
00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:06.160
Come on, wake up. Please, wake up.

47
00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:07.720
It's coming alive.

48
00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:10.500
No, AyShe. It's waking up.

49
00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:11.780
Just like you.

50
00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:14.800
A wave of light spread out.

51
00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:16.720
All of Elyra was waking up.

52
00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:19.930
22 more capsules are waking up.

53
00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:23.480
Pusula was brighter than ever.

54
00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:25.100
So I'm not alone.

55
00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:32.010
AyShe, can you hear me?

56
00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:33.530
There's something here.

57
00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:34.620
Help me.

58
00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:36.290
Leon, who are you?

59
00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:39.190
AyShe had awakened.

60
00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:42.330
But Leon's voice was coming from very far away.

